&lt;strong&gt;Topics covered in this episode:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/profiling.sampling.html?featured_on=pythonbytes"&gt;Tachyon: A sampling profiler ships in Python 3.15's stdlib&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.cloudflare.com/python-workers-ga/?featured_on=pythonbytes"&gt;Python Workers are now generally available on Cloudflare&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://flet.dev/blog/flet-1-0?featured_on=pythonbytes"&gt;Flet 1.0 - build cross-platform apps in Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/ljchang/marimo-book?featured_on=pythonbytes"&gt;marimo-book: Build static books from marimo notebooks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extras&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joke&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=__iKh7BNDgM' style='font-weight: bold;' data-umami-event="Livestream-Past" data-umami-event-episode="497"&gt;Watch on YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;

