&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Heading to Europe in October? PyCon NL is October 15th in Utrecht. One day, three tracks, about 350 people. It's an hour by train from Schiphol. There's also a session just for community organizers from groups like PyLadies, PyData, and Django. And the location fits. The Netherlands is where Python itself was born.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

